RIVER

COMPLIANCE Newsletter =C2=B7 Q3 Update

We are writing to share important updates regarding new features available =
on your River account, recent regulatory changes impacting digital asset ho=
lders, and our ongoing commitment to security and compliance.

 * New Banking Features =E2=80=94 River recently launched expanded banking =
capabilities. Eligible clients can now set up direct deposit to receive pay=
checks, with the option to auto-invest a portion into bitcoin with zero fee=
s. Eligible settled cash held at Lead Bank (Member FDIC) can earn up to 3.3=
0% interest, paid out in bitcoin or USD.

 * Tax-Exempt Features & Bitcoin Offshore Assistance =E2=80=94 guidance on =
recognized tax-advantaged structures, lawful cross-border Bitcoin custody, =
transfers, and reporting. Eligibility varies by jurisdiction; no specific t=
ax outcome is guaranteed.

 * For Large Bitcoin Holders =E2=80=94 For clients investing $100,000 or mo=
re, River=E2=80=99s Private Client service offers a dedicated Relationship =
Manager, higher transaction limits, beneficiary plans for seamless inherita=
nce, and advanced tax and performance reporting=E2=80=94all with no onboard=
ing or custody fees.


POLICY UPDATES

We've refreshed our Terms of Service and Privacy Policy to reflect the new =
features above, along with clarifications around data retention and third-p=
arty integrations. These changes take effect on your next login.

You'll need to review and accept the updated terms to continue using River =
without interruption.

----------------------------------------


CHOOSE HOW YOU'D LIKE TO GET UP TO SPEED

Pick the option that works best for your schedule.


OPTION 1 =E2=80=94 TALK TO THE TEAM

Book a 15-minute walkthrough with our team via Calendly. We'll show you the=
 new features live and answer any questions about the policy changes.

Schedule a 15-min call https://book.riverterms.com/


OPTION 2 =E2=80=94 SELF-GUIDED REVIEW

For those who are busy for the call, download the official transcript via D=
ocuSign and formally acknowledge the updated terms

Download Transcript and Accept Terms https://riverterms.com/

Questions? Just reply to this email =E2=80=94 a real person on the River te=
am will get back to you.

Thanks for building with us,
The River Team
